  "description": "HomeKit GarageDoorOpener for ratgdo-controlled Security+ 1.0 garage doors that ignores false photo-eye obstructions. Sends a single forceClose POST to the ratgdo, which performs the wall-button hold-to-close override on the device side. Requires the Haglerd/homekit-ratgdo32 firmware fork.",
